  "object_review": {
    "O150": "Reviewed event-to-order/position/instrument/candidate relationships before replay, explicitly linked order generations, occurrence/availability/snapshot/use clocks, pending and unknown rows, caller policy-marker handling, and source-policy cancellation. Rejected or unverifiable records cannot certify filled/position quantities; separately named known-prefix quantities retain useful observed arithmetic. Reviewed valid partial fills, cancel/expiry, amend/reopen, and exits after entry cancellation.",
    "O151": "Reviewed actual fill occurrence separately from availability, preserved report order/position/instrument provenance, rejected contradictory report clocks and singular foreign reports, and retained each report for O150 replay so a later pending partial fill cannot hide an earlier valid fill. Modeled touch eligibility remains separate from observed execution and queue evidence.",
    "O166": "Reviewed explicit B/A/D/E/W labels for both adjacent state observations, context/cohort/reset identity, conditioning clocks, and snapshot/use limits. Missing labels retain null states and explicit holes with unknown transition validity; invalid labels/clocks reject. Correct future states remain pending and explicit unknown availability stays unknown. No classifier or learned matrix was introduced."
  },
  "legacy_hole_schema_review": {
    "O001": "Original P01 is blocked for missing native inputs. Reviewed the opt-in guard payload hook so the unavailable result retains the complete coverage schema, explicit unknown checks and missing evidence without inventing native members.",
    "O006": "Original P03 lacked a verified native clock/range identity. Reviewed the corrected O006 recipe identifier and complete partial clock-range payload; retained literal bounds and formation endpoints while width, identity and clock verification remain unknown.",
    "O015": "Original P04 cannot establish a selected contact band. Reviewed nullable unavailable band fields; unknown bands remain None rather than manufactured numeric bands.",
    "O056": "Original P08 lacks validated candle identity/timeframe evidence. Reviewed the opt-in full partial orderblock payload with nullable missing geometry/confirmation and no invented candle IDs. It remains a hole."
  },
  "shared_review": {
    "C01": "Actual immutable REF source citations rerun the domain with outer instrument/method/snapshot context. Explicit context contradictions reject in both dependency and operand admission. Foreign event identity cannot be laundered through source or parent-derived wrappers.",
    "C04": "Reviewed occurrence <= availability <= consumed snapshot and snapshot <= use, with preserved timestamps. Proper future tails stay pending. Unknown inner availability is not replaced by an outer known timestamp. Existing native invalid-parent and unknown-clock aggregation remains applicable without modification.",
    "C08": "Reviewed the exact two valid and four invalid independent inputs, valid state-machine controls, real audited parent compositions, and gate mutation tests. The acceptance matrix and final gate now require current six-case evidence and independently recheck its recorded invariants."
  },
